  "behavior": [
    "Exact immutable controller inventory remains live throughout the run. Runtime existing-only pins all nonzero registered capacities atomically in the same pool.",
    "Controller contribution decomposes fixed additional host allowance before component composition; full diagnostics preserve the original estimate. No source capacity is subtracted from an equation or sampling peak.",
    "Fresh and cached execution use one sealed incremental proof and the same candidate/core-policy planner. Combined source and decoder credit retains independent aggregate accounting pins.",
    "Reservation retains original Admission metadata through funding conversion. Metadata contains no source payload or accounting pin.",
    "Reservation, run and outstanding scopes own all excluded charges. Temporary quote pins retire after funding custody is established. Uncertified work retains both pins in quarantine.",
    "Native existing-only pin failure uses the complete controller allowance. Normal source adoption and provenance checks still precede preparation; mixed inventories receive no partial credit.",
    "Final emitted masks, optional filtering, forced pre-override overlap and controller history remain fully priced."
  ],
